<> Coda
|------------------------------------|------------------------------------|
|------------------------------------|------------------------------------|
|------------------------------------|------------------------------------|
|--7--7--7--7--7-----------(7)\------|--3---2---------2-------------------|
|--5--5--5--5--5-----------(5)\------|--3---2---------2-------------------|
|------------------------------------|--1---0---------0-------------------|

b= Bend pb= Pre Bend cb= Compound Bend ub= Unison Bend r= release 
+1= 1 Fret +2= 2 Frets /\= Slide p= Pull-Off h= Hammer-On
D.S. S/S Al Coda <>= Go Back To (S/S) Sign And Play Until You Reach 
                     (To Coda <>) Sign And Go To (<> Coda) Sign.

